// M4 == C506 REINTRODUCED: the capacity record exists but the ALLOCATABLE domain
// forgets the two permanently-live root ids, so the engine believes it has two
// more slots than the arena has.  This is the C514/C506 shape -- a count
// compared against a capacity in the WRONG DOMAIN -- reintroduced at its
// narrowest.  Single mutation.
fn cap_alloc(W:[]u8)i32 { return nodecap(W); }
